{"id":"633686","name":"炒螺丝粉","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/633686/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"螺丝粉","amount":"2包"}],"sub":[{"name":"火腿肠","amount":"2根"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"2个"},{"name":"上海青","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"螺丝粉包将干粉冷水下锅，煮至粉条变软无硬芯。","img":"images/633686/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"煮好的粉过凉水沥干水份。","img":"images/633686/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"火腿肠切片备用。","img":"images/633686/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"上海青洗净备用。","img":"images/633686/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"锅中热油打入鸡蛋炒散。","img":"images/633686/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"放入火腿肠翻炒。","img":"images/633686/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放入笋包禾酸豆角配料，翻炒均匀。","img":"images/633686/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"放入上海青翻炒。","img":"images/633686/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"加入粉条快速翻炒。","img":"images/633686/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"加入螺丝粉的汤料包。","img":"images/633686/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"放入豆腐皮和花生。","img":"images/633686/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"加入适量辣椒油，喜欢辣的可以多加，快速翻炒均匀入味即可。","img":"images/633686/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/633686/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/633686/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/633686/step_15.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}